<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: right; background-color: white; color: #212529"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Emerging
growth company <span id="xdx_90C_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20240808__20240808_zddY1019AoTi"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-08-08" format="ixt:booleantrue" id="Fact000030" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9746;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white; color: #212529"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white; color: #212529"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">If
