with any new or revised financial accounting standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. <span id="xdx_903_edei--EntityExTransitionPeriod_c20240808__20240808_zDoaUyf3Wo6i"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-08-08" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000031" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

